@grid 35 15

#
SNAKE in CPL  -  8x8 field, walls wrap to the other side.

BEFORE RUNNING: set the IDE "Step limit" to 1000000 (the maximum)
and the speed to Fast or Normal.

PLAY FIELD : top-left 8x8 block (x 0-7, y 0-7). White = snake or food.
CONTROLS   : turn ON one of these cells (the program turns it OFF itself)
    UP    = (11,9)
    LEFT  = (10,10)   RIGHT = (12,10)
    DOWN  = (11,11)
  (they form a 3x3 pad at x 10-12, y 9-11; the centre cell is unused)
RULES      : eat food to grow. Hitting your own body ends the game.
  Turning straight back into your own neck is ignored.
HIDDEN STATE (leave alone): the other blocks and rows hold the game
  memory (food marker, direction bits, head/tail/food-cursor positions).
#

